sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Driver
    participant LPR as LPR Camera
    participant MW as Middleware
    participant SAP as SAP / SAB
    participant Kiosk as Kiosk UI
    participant Gate as Gate Adapter
    participant Queue as Queue Engine

    LPR->>+MW: POST /lpr/plate-read
    MW->>+SAP: lookupByPlate(plate)
    SAP-->>-MW: ClientProfile name phone plate
    MW->>MW: createSession + save Redis
    MW->>Kiosk: session.update via Socket.io /kiosk

    Driver->>Kiosk: Yes — touch or voice
    Kiosk->>+MW: session.input choice yes
    MW->>MW: handleInput — state Done
    MW->>Kiosk: session.update

    MW->>Gate: openGate(gateId) stub
    Gate-->>MW: gate.opened event
    MW->>+Queue: enqueueVisit plate phone gateId
    Queue-->>-MW: queue.enqueued
